@@ -1,4 +1,17 @@
 -------------------------------------------------------------------
+Sun Nov 15 16:34:52 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>
+
+- home:caiocco: add nomacs-respect-platform-font.patch: nomacs'
+  base stylesheet forces an 11pt UI font (and widgets hardcode
+  sizes relative to it), overriding the system Qt font size set in
+  qt5ct/qt6ct. All style sheet font sizes and the hardcoded ones
+  are now scaled by (system font size / 11pt).
+- Drop %suse_update_desktop_file: merging desktop-translations
+  duplicated the Comment[de] and Comment[pt] keys already in the
+  upstream .desktop (rpmlint invalid-desktopfile). Validate the
+  file with desktop-file-validate in %check instead.
+
